      "tests": [
        {
          "id": "mms_column_variable_k_faceflux_forced",
          "description": "Manufactured solution u(z,t) = exp(-t) cos(pi z) with K = 1 + z and the prescribed linear interface flux F = 0.3 z, the matching forcing S (heat_column_varcoeff_forced's plus 0.3), quadratic-stretch column. The t=0 assertion pins the ic wiring; the t=0.1 assertion bounds the L2 error at the default NLEV = 64 (second-order, and equal to heat_column_varcoeff_forced's to round-off because the linear F is discretely exact; per-resolution values pinned in tests/conformance/convergence/heat_column_varcoeff_faceflux_forced/golden/errors.json).",
